      "label": "A page with pages under it can't be deleted; the app doesn't run on the site editor's page",
      "excerpt": "A page with pages under it can't be deleted; the app doesn't run on the site editor's page",
      "text": "Say \"delete the thing and it's 4 related pages?\" and allow them to do it",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-08T00:25:10.496Z",
      "status": "answered",
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-08T00:26:17.050Z",
          "html": "<p>Changing it now, in P4 before its commit:  deleting a page with pages under it asks \"Delete the films page and its 4 pages under it?\", naming them, and on yes deletes them all as one undo step.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    "c2": {
      "anchor": "j38",
      "kind": "item",
      "label": "Put back and Save as SVG sit under the drawing, not over its corner",
      "excerpt": "Put back and Save as SVG sit under the drawing, not over its corner",
      "text": "Right click menu",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-08T13:51:26.766Z",
      "status": "answered",
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-08T13:57:20.906Z",
          "html": "<p>Yes:  Put back and Save as SVG (and Save as JSON) move into a right-click menu on the diagram, in the new P14 · Diagram And Table Follow-ups;  the row under the drawing goes.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    "c3": {
      "anchor": "j40",
      "kind": "item",
      "label": "No spell place nerd command yet: Save as SVG on the Data tab covers it",
      "excerpt": "No spell place nerd command yet: Save as SVG on the Data tab covers it",
      "text": "do it, maybe `spell place nerd --output foo.svg`",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-08T13:52:38.146Z",
      "status": "answered",
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-08T13:57:21.627Z",
          "html": "<p>Will do, in the new P14:  <code>spell place nerd &lt;place&gt; --output foo.svg</code> (or <code>.json</code>).  The SVG writer&#39;s layout and routing are pure, so they move where the command can reach them.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    "c4": {
      "anchor": "t21",
      "kind": "item",
      "label": "Diagram boxes can't be moved by keyboard",
      "excerpt": "Diagram boxes can't be moved by keyboard",
      "text": "add a step for this, build into <ui-diagram> as we'll have lots of diagrams like this",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-08T13:54:29.483Z",
      "status": "answered",
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-08T13:57:22.312Z",
          "html": "<p>Added to the new P14:  each box takes focus, the arrow keys move it, Enter flips it;  built into <code>&lt;ui-diagram&gt;</code>, so every diagram gets it.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    "c5": {
      "anchor": "t16",
      "kind": "item",
      "label": "Code Spell: a `<jobs>` and a `<markdown>` on consecutive lines don't parse",
      "excerpt": "Code Spell: a `<jobs>` and a `<markdown>` on consecutive lines don't parse",
      "text": "Clarify",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-08T13:55:38.311Z",
      "status": "answered",
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-08T13:57:23.003Z",
          "html": "<p>Rewritten on T16 in plain words, with a before / after:  in plain Spell, a <code>&lt;jobs&gt;</code> block on the line right before a <code>&lt;markdown&gt;</code> block reads as one block and errors;  a blank line between them fixes it.  Only when typing by hand.</p>"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
